    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rustic Defense is a hexagonal fantasy tower defense game with roguelike elements, generated enviroment with option explore your own way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in classic tower defense game, you build turrets that fight with incoming enemies.  <br>You can research 15 types of turrets that belong to five categories (archery, natural, guns, throwing, splash). Every turret has physical damage, advanced turrets adds elemental damage bonus (fire, poison, ice) and special attack feature. Elemental damage rise overtime damage or slowing monsters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/a858ae8713d2f4b437e0a34dde5715a6.avif?t=1755033192\" data-has-big width=800 height=134 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies incoming from four bioms. The <strong>Valley</strong> is nearest and enemies haven't any armor. <strong>Mountains</strong>, <strong>Desert</strong> and <strong>Swamp</strong>\u00a0monsters has<strong> </strong>armor with resistances to specific elemental attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/06b01020fbe4e29d89300e3310c5d3e8.avif?t=1755033192\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map and enviroment is randomly generated. After each wave you can choose way that you want to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every game you obtain experiences depends on reached wave. Those experiences you can convert to skills in skill tree, that give you advantage for rest of game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/b1e583c281a9237bd29d1a80a72b6bff.avif?t=1755033192\" data-has-big width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills are passive (permament) and active, that you can choose during game on carddeck. <br>If you have more skills and feel confident, you can choose two or three way game and earn more experience. In late game you can research speciality like support from sea or chance to deal epic card that can change game.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rustic Defense is a hexagonal fantasy tower defense game with roguelike elements, generated enviroment with option explore your own way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in classic tower defense game, you build turrets that fight with incoming enemies.  <br>You can research 15 types of turrets that belong to five categories (archery, natural, guns, throwing, splash). Every turret has physical damage, advanced turrets adds elemental damage bonus (fire, poison, ice) and special attack feature. Elemental damage rise overtime damage or slowing monsters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/a858ae8713d2f4b437e0a34dde5715a6.avif?t=1755033192\" data-has-big width=800 height=134 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies incoming from four bioms. The <strong>Valley</strong> is nearest and enemies haven't any armor. <strong>Mountains</strong>, <strong>Desert</strong> and <strong>Swamp</strong>\u00a0monsters has<strong> </strong>armor with resistances to specific elemental attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/06b01020fbe4e29d89300e3310c5d3e8.avif?t=1755033192\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map and enviroment is randomly generated. After each wave you can choose way that you want to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every game you obtain experiences depends on reached wave. Those experiences you can convert to skills in skill tree, that give you advantage for rest of game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/b1e583c281a9237bd29d1a80a72b6bff.avif?t=1755033192\" data-has-big width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills are passive (permament) and active, that you can choose during game on carddeck. <br>If you have more skills and feel confident, you can choose two or three way game and earn more experience. In late game you can research speciality like support from sea or chance to deal epic card that can change game.\u00a0</p>",
